# Project map

Single-page app. `GET /` concatenates partials in `_web/respond.py` `send_app_page`: `frontend/shell.html`, `frontend/features/app-frame.html`, `frontend/features/workflow.html`, `frontend/features/pipeline.html`, `frontend/features/prospects.html`, `frontend/features/settings.html`, `frontend/shell-end.html`. Top tabs (Global CRM, Workflow, Pipeline) switch in `frontend/_core/navigation.js`. Legacy dialer/AI/performance UI is archived under `misc/frontend-legacy/`.

## Folders

- `server.py`, `web.py`, `dialer.py` — process entry; `dialer.py` only calls `serve()`
- `features/` — routes and rules (`dialer.py`, `metrics.py`, `prospects.py`, `settings.py`, `accounts.py`)
- `features/_dialer/` — server session, queue, Twilio, outcomes, projection
- `features/_prospects/` — CSV import/export and local/Supabase storage
- `shared/` — `config.py`, `vocabulary.py` (constants only), `dial_policy.py` (pool, caps, connect, callbacks), `infra.py`; `shared/_infra/` is Supabase and file helpers
- `_web/` — `respond.py` (page, static, JSON) and `hooks.py` (Twilio webhook)
- `frontend/` — `main.js` boot, `core.js` re-exports, shell partials
- `frontend/_core/` — browser `state`, API client, navigation, format helpers
- `frontend/features/` — page partials and feature entry scripts
- `frontend/features/_dialer/`, `_prospects/`, `_performance/`, `_arcade/` — feature parts
- `frontend/css/` — base styles `01`–`09`; `frontend/css/linear/` loads after and overrides (`FRONTEND_DIR` in `shared/config.py`)
- `tests/`, `scripts/` — tests and `check_static.py`
- `misc/` — design docs, one-off scripts, unused frontend modules (not served)

## Pages

- Dialer: `frontend/features/dialer.html` `#dialerTabPanel`; JS `frontend/features/dialer.js` and `frontend/features/_dialer/`
- AI Dialer Agent: `frontend/features/ai-dialer-agent.html` `#aiDialerAgentTabPanel` (fleet + per-seat UI). Human dialer DOM lives only under `#dialerTabPanel`; use `dialerEl` / `setDialerText` in `frontend/_core/format.js` for human chrome. AI tab uses `aiDialerAgent-*` ids and `frontend/features/_ai_dialer/*` renderers.
- Session summary modal: `frontend/features/session-summary-dialog.html`
- Prospects: `frontend/features/prospects.html` `#prospectsTabPanel`; JS `frontend/features/prospects.js` and `frontend/features/_prospects/`
- Caller pool: `#poolTabPanel` is in `frontend/features/prospects.html`; render `frontend/features/_dialer/pool-view.js`; timezone `frontend/features/_dialer/pool.js`
- Performance: `frontend/features/performance.html` `#metricsPanel` wraps only `#performanceTabPanel`. JS `frontend/features/performance.js`. `setDashboardTab` shows `#metricsPanel` only on the Performance tab; Prospects/Pool/Dials panels are siblings in `#dashboard-top-row`.
- Workflow: `frontend/features/workflow.html` `#workflowTabPanel`. JS `frontend/features/workflow.js`. Styles `frontend/css/linear/workflow.css`. Visual node canvas (preview); drag layout persisted in `localStorage`.

## Layout, tokens, charts

- Chrome: `frontend/shell.html` (`.app-shell`, `.side-nav`, `#loginGate`). Page frame (`main`, `#crmView`, `.page-heading`, `.dashboard-stack`) opens in `frontend/features/dialer.html` and closes in `frontend/features/prospects.html`.
- Layout CSS: `frontend/css/02-layout.css`, `frontend/css/09-shell.css`. Overrides: `frontend/css/linear/shell.css`, `frontend/css/linear/document.css`.
- Tokens: `frontend/css/01-tokens.css` `:root` (`--ink`, `--canvas`, `--primary`, radii). That file also has shell rules; do not add more there.
- Charts: `frontend/features/_performance/charts.js` (`buildMetricsLineChart`, `buildStatusPieChart`, `buildConnectionPieChart`). Markup in `frontend/features/performance.html`. Styles `frontend/css/05-charts.css`, then `frontend/css/linear/metrics.css`.

## Styling

Plain CSS. Link order in `frontend/shell.html` is the cascade: `01-tokens.css` through `09-shell.css`, then `css/linear/*`. Numbered files use `var(--*)`. `linear/` repeats those colors as hex and wins on equal specificity. Edit the rule that currently wins, and use a token from `01-tokens.css` instead of a new hex. Reuse classes already on the nodes (`side-link`, `dialer-document`, `stat-tile`, `button-primary`).

## Dialer and metrics state

- Snapshot: `frontend/_core/state.js` `state` (`leads`, `pool`, `metrics`, dialer flags) and `S` (poll clock, tab, voice, session UI).
- Fetch: `frontend/features/_dialer/poller.js` `refreshState` every 1.5s — `GET /api/live`, `GET /api/leads` when `leads_version` changes (not full `/api/state`), `GET /api/metrics` every 15s into `state.metrics`. Client merge helpers: `frontend/_core/sync-state.js`. Then `render()` in `frontend/_core/render.js` → `runRenderers()` in `frontend/_core/registry.js` runs only tab-scoped painters (`dialer`, `aiDialerAgent`, `prospects`, `pool`, etc.).
- Dialer paint: `frontend/features/_dialer/render-dialer.js`, registered from `frontend/features/dialer.js`.
- Metrics paint: `frontend/features/performance.js` `renderMetrics`.
- Server: `features/dialer.py` `GET /api/state` (dialer snapshot, no lead rows), `GET /api/leads` (CRM table + pool), `GET /api/live`. `features/metrics.py` `GET /api/metrics`.